# Fragments a well-behaved sender cannot produce are ignored, not fatal: an
# id 256 or more ahead of the next expected, and a fragment count that
# disagrees with an earlier fragment of the same message. The datagram is
# still accepted, and the real message completes.
endpoint client 0123456789abcdef 4800 1024 262144 200000 plain 0 0 0 0
recv 10000 4d525131efcdab89674523010000ffff000000000202000001000101aa000001020102
recv 20000 
recv 30000 
> reliable 
> reliable 01
